{"chapterId":"v4-023","title":"中国人民解放军总部关于重行颁布三大纪律八项注意的训令","duration":94.176,"cues":[{"text":"一、本军三大纪律八项注意，","start":12.84,"end":17.52,"page":131},{"text":"实行多年，","start":17.52,"end":19.08,"page":131},{"text":"其内容各地各军略有出入。","start":19.08,"end":23.1,"page":131},{"text":"现在统一规定，","start":23.64,"end":25.36,"page":131},{"text":"重行颁布。","start":25.36,"end":27.08,"page":131},{"text":"望即以此为准，","start":27.92,"end":30.16,"page":131},{"text":"深入教育，","start":30.16,"end":31.58,"page":131},{"text":"严格执行。","start":31.58,"end":32.98,"page":131},{"text":"至于其他应当注意事项，","start":32.98,"end":36.24,"page":131},{"text":"各地各军最高首长，","start":36.24,"end":38.74,"page":131},{"text":"可根据具体情况，","start":38.74,"end":40.82,"page":131},{"text":"规定若干项目，","start":40.82,"end":42.86,"page":131},{"text":"以命令施行之。","start":42.86,"end":44.68,"page":131},{"text":"二、三大纪律如下：","start":46.1,"end":49.42,"page":131},{"text":"（一）一切行动听指挥；","start":50.18,"end":53.64,"page":131},{"text":"（二）不拿群众一针一线；","start":54.4,"end":58.06,"page":131},{"text":"（三）一切缴获要归公。","start":58.96,"end":62.42,"page":131},{"text":"三、八项注意如下：","start":64.38,"end":67.54,"page":131},{"text":"（一）说话和气；","start":68.26,"end":70.62,"page":131},{"text":"（二）买卖公平；","start":70.62,"end":73.42,"page":131},{"text":"（三）借东西要还；","start":73.42,"end":76.4,"page":131},{"text":"（四）损坏东西要赔；","start":77.0,"end":79.66,"page":131},{"text":"（五）不打人骂人；","start":80.38,"end":83.02,"page":131},{"text":"（六）不损坏庄稼；","start":83.02,"end":85.96,"page":131},{"text":"（七）不调戏妇女；","start":86.52,"end":88.98,"page":131},{"text":"（八）不虐待俘虏。","start":89.66,"end":92.22,"page":131}],"status":"verified","textStatus":"official-book-crosschecked","alignmentCoverage":1.0,"sourceBook":"https://ebook.theorychina.org.cn/ebook/upload/storage/files/2022/07/26/6824fdc14cb3177c1199dbd1e97f7d6013320/mobile/index.html#p=131","sourceAudio":"https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/","canonicalTextSha256":"45b1bee8af3825ca7075e794cb046e4319f2742a52b9721d0a5050b5931a6b2b","audioTextDifferences":[],"verification":"正文已与理论中国原版比对并处理文字差异。字幕按官方录音逐词定位，异常片段另行重识别和复核；不宣称整套逐句人工复听。原书注释、特殊字形和版式请看原版书页。"}